ses offered within the university.</p><p>3) Students who do not meet the enrolment requisite for MATH1110 must take MATH1002 Foundational Studies in Mathematics. For these students MATH1002 will count for 10 units of electives.</p> </div></div>',
    apply_form = 'https://handbook.newcastle.edu.au/program/2026/40302?year=2026',
    updated_at = NOW()
WHERE cricos_course_code = '';

