/li><li>Electives include any unrestricted courses offered within the university.</li><li>Students who do not meet the enrolment requisite for MATH1110 must take MATH1002 Foundational Studies in Mathematics. For these students MATH1002 will count for 10 units of Electives.</li></ul> </div></div>',
