    entry_requirements = '<div class="css-1bxk47o-Box--Box-Box-Card--CardBody e12hqxty1"><div class="css-yd08g9-Box--Box-Box-Attribute--AttrContainer ene3w3n3" display=""><div class="css-t643gp-Attribute--AttrBody ene3w3n1" data-testid="AttrBody"><div class="css-19qn38w-Box--Box-Box-Flex--Flex-Flex e8qda2r1"> </div><div class="css-1nx81rv-Attribute--AttributeChildrenWrap ene3w3n0"><div class="css-apyj4p-Box--Box-Box-Card--CardBody e12hqxty1"><p><strong>3-year (240 unit) Program</strong></p> <ul> <li>Graduates from the University of Newcastle or another institution with a Bachelor degree in Engineering in a non-cognate field AND a GPA of 4.5 or above</li> <li>Non-engineering Bachelor Degree with at least 20 units of study in Mathematics (especially calculus and linear algebra); and Science, as related to Engineering AND a UON GPA of 4.5 or above.</li> <li>You may also be eligible for Recognition of Prior Learning (RPL) which will be assessed on a case-by-case basis.</li> </ul> </div></div></div></div></div> <div class="css-jshiy7-Box--Box-Box-Flex--Flex-Flex e8qda2r1">English language requirements </div> <div class="css-1bxk47o-Box--Box-Box-Card--CardBody e12hqxty1"><div class="css-apyj4p-Box--Box-Box-Card--CardBody e12hqxty1"><p><strong>3-year full time (240 units) </strong></p> <p>The MPE (Mechanical) is comprised of 240 units, of which, 190 units are core courses, 40 units are courses chosen from the Course List and 10 units are elective courses. </p> </div></div>',
